  "citation": "Goyet C; Guenther P R; Keeling C D; Talley L D (1997): CO2, Hydrographic, and Chemical Data Obtained During the R/V Thomas Washington Cruise TUNES-3 in the Equatorial Pacific Ocean (WOCE section P16C). CDIAC. Dataset. doi:10.3334/CDIAC/OTG.NDP060",
  "dataset": {
    "@context": "http://schema.org/",
